             "copies/hj604wr7502#inscription"
            ],
            "note": "Graded high on the figures of the date: every figure is plain. Crop 1, lower panel upright; pencil, one short line, nothing else in the crop. Six figures in two groups, 14 and 1123, all plain: the two 1s of the month repeat the flag of the first figure, and the 2 and 3 are distinct. Read as 14.11.23."
           }
          ]
         }
        }
       }
      }
